{
  "label": "Membuat Rule Pertama",
  "category": "Tutorials",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Membuat Rule Pertama",
      "id": "tutorial-first-rule",
      "intro": "Buat rule deteksi fraud pertama Anda dengan mengikuti langkah-langkah di bawah ini. Kita akan membuat rule GENERAL sederhana: deteksi transfer di atas Rp50.000.000 ke luar negeri.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Buka Halaman Scenario Studio",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Klik menu **Scenario Studio** di sidebar kiri\n\u2022 Lihat daftar rule yang sudah ada (mungkin kosong)\n\u2022 Klik **+ Tambah Scenario** di pojok kanan atas",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eff6ff;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 5a1 1 0 011-1h4a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1V5z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Scenario Studio</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#3b82f6;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">+ Tambah Scenario</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-size:7px;color:#64748b;\">Daftar rule akan muncul di sini</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Pilih Tipe Rule",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **GENERAL** \u2014 3 langkah, untuk rule sederhana\n\u2022 **CONDITION** \u2014 4 langkah, untuk rule kompleks\n\u2022 Pilih GENERAL dulu untuk belajar",
          "color": "#f97316",
          "bg": "#fff7ed",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fed7aa;overflow:hidden;padding:8px;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:8px;border:2px solid #f59e0b;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffbeb,#fff);overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;text-align:center;\">GENERAL</div><div style=\"padding:6px 8px;font-size:7px;color:#475569;text-align:center;\">3 langkah<span style=\"display:block;font-size:6px;color:#94a3b8;\">Sederhana</span></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;overflow:hidden;opacity:.6;\"><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;background:#e2e8f0;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center;\">CONDITION</div><div style=\"padding:6px 8px;font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center;\">4 langkah<span style=\"display:block;font-size:6px;color:#cbd5e1;\">Kompleks</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Isi Parameter Rule (Step 1)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **Rule Name** \u2014 Nama rule (contoh: Deteksi Transfer Besar ke Luar Negeri)\n\u2022 **Risk Score** \u2014 Nilai 0-100, makin tinggi makin berbahaya\n\u2022 **Priority** \u2014 HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW\n\u2022 **Active Period** \u2014 Jadwal aktif rule (misal: 24/7)",
          "color": "#22c55e",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:4px;background:#22c55e;flex-shrink:0;\"></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;flex:1;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 15V3m0 12l-4-4m4 4l4-4M2 17l.621 2.485A2 2 0 004.561 21h14.878a2 2 0 001.94-1.515L22 17\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Configure Parameters</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:3px;background:#f0fdf4;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#16a34a;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;\">Step 1 of 3</span></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:6px;color:#64748b;\">Rule Name</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Deteksi Transfer Besar</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:6px;color:#64748b;\">Risk Score</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;\">75</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:6px;color:#64748b;\">Priority</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;\">HIGH</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:6px;color:#64748b;\">Active Period</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">24/7</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Bangun Detection Flow (Step 2)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **CONSTANT** \u2014 Field: amount, Operator: >, Value: 50000000\n\u2022 **CONTAINS** \u2014 Field: destination, Operator: EQUALS, Value: FOREIGN\n\u2022 **LOGICAL AND** \u2014 Gabungkan kedua kondisi\n\u2022 **ALERT** \u2014 Hasil akhir kirim alert\n\u2022 Hubungkan: Start \u2192 CONSTANT \u2192 AND \u2192 ALERT dan Start \u2192 CONTAINS \u2192 AND",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#f1f5f9);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #22c55e;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">START</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">AMOUNT > 50JT</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #10b981;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981;\">IS FOREIGN</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #6366f1;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">AND</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #ef4444;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#ef4444;\">ALERT</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Review & Submit (Step 3)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Lihat ringkasan rule (nama, risk score, priority, flow diagram)\n\u2022 Periksa node dan konfigurasi yang sudah dibuat\n\u2022 Klik **Submit** untuk menyimpan rule sebagai Draft",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;background:#f5f3ff;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd6fe;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Review Summary</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:3px;background:#fff;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#7c3aed;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;\">Step 3 of 3</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-size:7px;color:#475569;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><div>Rule: Deteksi Transfer Besar ke Luar Negeri</div><div>Risk: 75 | Priority: HIGH</div><div>Nodes: 4 \u2014 Start, 2 Conditions, Alert</div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
